Kids are ditching piggy banks for financial apps

RIP, piggy banks =E2=80=94 the ceramic cash containers of our youths are on=
 their way to becoming relics of an analog era.

Doing them in: a host of new, parent-favored financial apps that have emerg=
ed in recent years to teach today=E2=80=99s kids how to budget, save, and i=
nvest their money, per (https://www.washingtonpost.com/business/2025/11/10/=
families-phone-apps-financial/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-_y6yAr2UXprRfYjC3WqUnP18s9F=
